<% content_for :title, "Name Change Request Submitted" %>

<div style="font-family:'Inter',Arial,sans-serif; color:#101828;">
  <div style="margin:0 0 10px;">
    <div style="font-family:'Montserrat','Inter',Arial,sans-serif; font-weight:800; font-size:18px; color:#00209F; margin:0;">
      Name Change Request Received
    </div>
    <div style="margin-top:6px; font-size:13px; color:#475467; line-height:1.6;">
      We've received your request and it is now under review.
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin:14px 0 12px; font-size:14px; line-height:1.75;">
    <p style="margin:0 0 10px;">
      Bonjou <strong><%= @user.first_name %></strong>,
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- ENGLISH -->
  <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"
         style="margin:10px 0 12px; background:#ffffff; border-radius:14px;
                border:1px solid rgba(0,32,159,0.18); overflow:hidden;">
    <tr>
      <td style="padding:14px; background:#f7f9ff;">
        <div style="font-size:12px; letter-spacing:0.6px; color:#1b2559; text-transform:uppercase; font-weight:900;">
          English
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top:8px; font-size:14px; line-height:1.75; color:#101828;">
          Your name change request has been <strong>submitted</strong> and is pending review.<br><br>
          <strong>Current name:</strong> <%= @request.old_full_name %><br>
          <strong>Requested name:</strong> <%= @request.new_full_name %><br>
          <strong>Reason:</strong> <%= @request.reason_label %><br><br>
          An administrator will review your request and supporting documents. You'll receive an email once a decision is made.
        </div>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <!-- KREYÒL -->
  <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"
         style="margin:0 0 12px; background:#ffffff; border-radius:14px;
                border:1px solid rgba(0,32,159,0.16); overflow:hidden;">
    <tr>
      <td style="padding:14px; background:#f7f9ff;">
        <div style="font-size:12px; letter-spacing:0.6px; color:#1b2559; text-transform:uppercase; font-weight:900;">
          Kreyòl
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top:8px; font-size:14px; line-height:1.75; color:#101828;">
          Demann chanjman non ou a <strong>soumèt</strong> epi li ap tann revizyon.<br><br>
          <strong>Non aktyèl:</strong> <%= @request.old_full_name %><br>
          <strong>Non ou mande:</strong> <%= @request.new_full_name %><br>
          <strong>Rezon:</strong> <%= @request.reason_label %><br><br>
          Yon administratè pral revize demann ou ak dokiman sipò yo. W ap resevwa yon imèl lè yo pran yon desizyon.
        </div>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <div style="margin-top:6px; font-size:13px; line-height:1.6; color:#475467;">
    Thank you / Mèsi anpil,
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top:12px; font-size:13px; color:#475467;">
    — The BonID Team
  </div>
</div>
